{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgfwsv24KvEyiJPrXhoCt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The three bands can't be fitted reliably with the octahedral d⁷ (Tanabe–Sugano) model, so I'm not giving Dq, B or C.**\n\nFor high-spin d⁷ the three spin-allowed bands are ν₁ = ⁴T₁g→⁴T₂g, ν₂ = ⁴T₁g→⁴A₂g and ν₃ = ⁴T₁g→⁴T₁g(P). I took the ⁴T₁g(F)/⁴T₁g(P) matrix as [[−6Dq, 6B], [6B, 15B+6Dq]], with ⁴T₂g at 2Dq and ⁴A₂g at 12Dq. I tested each plausible assignment of the bands:\n\n1. **9180 as ν₁ and 19550 as ν₂.** The model gives ν₂ − ν₁ = 10Dq exactly, so Dq ≈ 1037 cm⁻¹. Fitting ν₁ then gives B ≈ 785 cm⁻¹. The predicted ν₃ is about 26 000 cm⁻¹, but the observed band is at 20 320 cm⁻¹, so this fails.\n2. **9180 as ν₁ and 20320 as ν₃.** The fit gives B ≈ 430 cm⁻¹ and Dq ≈ 1100 cm⁻¹. That B is far too low for Co(II), which is normally about 800–950 cm⁻¹.\n3. **9180 as ν₁ and 19550 as ν₃.** The fit gives B ≈ 380 cm⁻¹, which is also unphysical.\n\nThe 19 550 and 20 320 cm⁻¹ bands are only about 770 cm⁻¹ apart, which is much too close to be ν₂ and ν₃. They are more likely a single ν₃ envelope split by spin–orbit coupling or by mixing with nearby spin-forbidden doublet states (²T₁g, ²A₁g). In that case ν₂ was not observed, or the complex is distorted from octahedral symmetry. Without ν₂, or without a clean ν₃ position, the model has more unknowns than usable bands. Any Dq and B I gave would be an artefact of the assignment, not a measurement.\n\nTo fix the parameters you would need a clearly assigned ν₂ (typically about 16 000–18 000 cm⁻¹ for Co(II)) and an unperturbed ν₃. A model that includes spin–orbit coupling and doublet-state mixing would also help.\n\n{\"Dq\": null, \"B\": null, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": true, \"reason\": \"No assignment of the three bands fits the d7 Tanabe–Sugano model with a realistic B, because the 19550/20320 pair looks like a split ν3 envelope (spin–orbit or doublet mixing) and ν2 is missing.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1659,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1659,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"abeed0a8-c2f8-483e-9ea2-2cddcce3aebb","uuid":"cda89427-4b0f-4906-8aa1-811a57457df6","timestamp":"2026-11-03T11:52:31.012Z","request_id":"req_011CgfwsudFXtawMacuLFr6q"}
